Agar a, b, aur c triangle ki sides hain, to sabse pehle check karte hain ki triangle ban sakta hai ya nahi.

Triangle Condition

Kisi bhi triangle ke liye:

a + b > c
a + c > b
b + c > a

Agar teeno conditions true hain, to triangle valid hai.

Java Program: Check Triangle Validity
import java.util.Scanner;

class Triangle {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        int a = sc.nextInt();
        int b = sc.nextInt();
        int c = sc.nextInt();

        if (a + b > c && a + c > b && b + c > a) {
            System.out.println("Valid Triangle");
        } else {
            System.out.println("Not a Triangle");
        }
    }
}
